  {{/air_handler}}
</ul>
{{/systems}}

<h3>Maintenance Performed</h3>

<p><strong>Heating side:</strong></p>
<ul>
  <li>Inspected heat exchanger for cracks, corrosion, and carbon buildup</li>
  <li>Cleaned and inspected burner assembly and flame sensor</li>
  <li>Checked ignition sequence and flame characteristics</li>
  <li>Verified gas pressure at manifold; adjusted as needed</li>
  <li>Measured temperature rise across heat exchanger; confirmed within manufacturer spec</li>
  <li>Tested safety controls: high-limit switch, rollout switch, pressure switch</li>
  <li>Inspected venting and combustion air intake for obstruction</li>
</ul>

<p><strong>Cooling side:</strong></p>
<ul>
  <li>Washed condenser coil and inspected for fin damage</li>
  <li>Checked refrigerant charge by superheat / subcooling method</li>
  <li>Measured temperature split across evaporator coil</li>
  <li>Tested capacitor microfarad rating against nameplate tolerance</li>
  <li>Measured amp draw on compressor and condenser fan motor</li>
  <li>Cleared condensate drain line; confirmed drain flow</li>
  <li>Inspected contactor for pitting and heat damage</li>
</ul>

<p><strong>Air-side:</strong></p>
<ul>
  <li>Replaced air filter (homeowner-supplied / contractor-supplied)</li>
  <li>Inspected blower wheel and motor; lubricated bearings where applicable</li>
  <li>Measured static pressure across air handler; verified within design range</li>
  <li>Inspected accessible ductwork for disconnections and insulation damage</li>
</ul>

{{#special_notes}}
<h3>Findings &amp; Recommendations</h3>
<p>{{special_notes}}</p>
{{/special_notes}}

